{
"content_id": "419460",
"reference_id": 109059,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "2 Petro 2:1–9",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "61002001-61002009",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Petro aliwaonya waumini wasiwaamini walimu waliokuwa wakifundisha mambo ambayo hayakuwa ya kweli. Walimu wa uongo hawakutaka yaliyo mema kwa waumini. Walitaka kuwatumia wafuasi wa Yesu vibaya.</p><p>Petro alieleza wazi kwamba Mungu angewazuia na kuleta <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108233\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">hukumu</data> dhidi yao. Alitumia mifano mitatu kutoka Agano la Kale. Mifano hii ilionyesha kwamba Mungu anajua jinsi ya kuhukumu na kuadhibu <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108218\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">viumbe waovu wa kiroho</data>.</p><p>Hali hiyo ni kweli kwa <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108525\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">watu wasiomcha Mungu</data>. Mifano pia ilionyesha kwamba Mungu anajua jinsi ya kuwalinda watu wacha Mungu.</p>",
